{
  "execute_help": {
    "text": "Usage: teamx actions execute (--request JSON | --request-file PATH) [--tool ENTRY]\nSubmit one complete action on the exact tools-list entry. Input and required evidence come from its resolved action.\nParameters: --request: {target_ref,turn_number,id,operation,input,context?}. Self message.send_self omits policy_token/authority. Group message.send requires current policy_token and authority:{type:human_reply,room_seq:ACTUAL_HUMAN_SEQ,reason:INTERPRETATION}. Other actions use rule/instruction {type,id,version,reason,constraints?} or human_reply {type,room_seq,reason,question_ref?,message_refs?,constraints?} as declared; rule forbids constraints. Optional context:{object_ref,unit_ref,unit_version} associates a matter, never grants authority. Legacy unit requests remain accepted. --request-file PATH: read the same JSON from a file; - reads stdin. Mutually exclusive with --request. Existing endpoint/body and business field limits still apply.\nCommon: --endpoint URL (bound TEAMX_ENDPOINT); --json (JSON output, default true). Requires the six bound TEAMX_* identity values.\nReturns: id, status, attempts, target_ref and result. Lark sends and GitLab MR comments/replies include operation, complete input, authority when required, exact account/target and result.verified plus any known result_id/reason. Full frozen evidence is available with actions read --id ID.\nExample: teamx actions execute --tool ENTRY --request '{\"target_ref\":\"ref_...\",\"turn_number\":1,\"id\":\"save-1\",\"operation\":\"message.send_self\",\"input\":{\"body\":\"保存这段文字\"}}'; or teamx actions execute --request-file payload.json (use - for stdin)\nConstraints: Follow input_schema: body is exact text; images, only when declared, are ordered {message_seq,attachment_id} from current Room human messages/attachments[].id. No extra attachment lookup or read receipt. One action/ID sends the entire selection; never split captions/images or fall back to a subset. Lark message replies remain text only. GitLab images are available only when input_schema declares them; production GitLab remains text only pending acceptance. GitLab image comments/replies require authority:{type:human_reply,room_seq,reason} and current policy_token, one attempt; rule/instruction/question authority is not accepted with images. Group sends require the direct Room instruction; self evidence grants no group permission. Reuse stable IDs; changed target/input/evidence conflicts. source/upload failure means nothing sent; unknown may already be sent: query actions read --id ORIGINAL_ID, never resend with a new ID/account/Session. Use error reason/next_action for the same account; platforms skill supplies requested repairs. Success means verified delivery, not read/business completion. Publish outcomes locally with send.\n\nGitLab image examples (isolated acceptance; production is text only until accepted):\nUse root actions execute --tool ENTRY; GitLab tools run ENTRY remains the native CLI proxy.\nOrdinary MR comment:\nteamx actions execute --tool ENTRY --request '{\"target_ref\":\"ref_MR\",\"turn_number\":1,\"id\":\"mr-images-1\",\"operation\":\"object.comment\",\"input\":{\"body\":\"问题截图与修复效果\",\"images\":[{\"message_seq\":120,\"attachment_id\":\"img_0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\"}]},\"policy_token\":\"CURRENT_TOKEN\",\"authority\":{\"type\":\"human_reply\",\"room_seq\":122,\"reason\":\"用户明确要求向该 MR 发送说明与这张图\"}}'\nExact discussion reply:\nteamx actions execute --tool ENTRY --request '{\"target_ref\":\"ref_EXACT_DISCUSSION\",\"turn_number\":1,\"id\":\"thread-images-1\",\"operation\":\"discussion.reply\",\"input\":{\"images\":[{\"message_seq\":121,\"attachment_id\":\"img_fedcba9876543210fedcba9876543210\"}]},\"policy_token\":\"CURRENT_TOKEN\",\"authority\":{\"type\":\"human_reply\",\"room_seq\":122,\"reason\":\"用户明确要求把第二张图回复到该准确讨论\"}}'\nauthority.room_seq is the sending instruction, not the image source. Reuse context:{object_ref,unit_ref,unit_version} for an existing matter without duplicate top-level matter fields. Copy actual refs/current turn/token; no arbitrary URL or native-ID target creation. Submit the whole selection once, then report the receipt. On ambiguity clarify; on unknown read the original ID and never resend.\n",
    "utf8_bytes": 4219
  },
